# Filling in a form in Russian: заявление, фамилия, подпись
subtitle: "Фамилия, гражданство, подпись: fill in an official Russian form and register for an exam."
tags: ["russian","russian forms","заявление","trki exam","russian vocabulary"]
teaches: ["writing/forms","phrases/formal-register"]
thumb: "band \"Fill in a Russian form\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"You look as if… in Russian: как будто, словно","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/167-russian-as-if.cast"}

