      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:3hnpvt'
    '|a||И́мя: first name. Без и́мени и фами́лии нельзя́.':
