      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:dlwqyi'
    '|a||До́лжность: your job title. Шеф-по́вар.':
