      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:p7zs7'
    '|a||И ли́чная по́дпись: по́дпись is a signature, ли́чный, personal.':
