      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1g3cy74'
    '|a||Forms often talk to you in the polite вы-command in -ите, the вы-colour: запо́лните, подпиши́те, as in lesson 109, запо́лните анке́ту.':
