      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:uda8by'
    '|a||Оплати́ть: to pay for, with no за: оплати́ть экза́мен, but заплати́ть за экза́мен. Paid: опла́чено, like запла́чено.':
