      ms: 11560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7l5f9w'
    '|a||Сдава́ть экза́мен: to take an exam. Сдать, from lesson 78, is to pass: я сдаю́, I''m taking it; я сдал, I passed.':
